Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gearcraft-daemon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Recommends: libhidapi-hidraw0
Description: Open-source multi-brand peripheral daemon
 GearCraft daemon talks to SteelSeries (and future brands) mice,
 keyboards and headsets over USB HID, exposing a Unix-socket IPC API
 used by the GearCraft desktop UI.
 .
 Alternative to proprietary SteelSeries GG on Linux.
